BT /F1 8 Tf 9 TL 30 760 Td (## Users and flows) Tj T* (Single developer/user now; the API is built per-user \(a `X-User-Id` header stands in for real) Tj T* (auth until the Later phase\).) Tj T* (1. Upload files \(`POST /documents`\) and receive `doc_id`s. 2. List or delete them. 3. `POST) Tj T* (/summarize` for a whole-document summary. 4. `POST /query` asks a question \(P1: single-shot) Tj T* (RAG; P3: agent, streamed over SSE\). 5. Follow-ups reuse a `session_id` \(P4\).) Tj ET
endstream
