BT /F1 8 Tf 9 TL 30 760 Td (## Features \(v1\)) Tj T* (- P0: bug fixes, models loaded once, non-blocking, 5 endpoints, per-document ids and metadata,) Tj T* (`llm` wrapper with mock mode, pydantic-settings config, uv with pinned deps, `prompts/*.md`.) Tj T* (- P1: hybrid BM25 + dense retrieval, cross-encoder rerank, parent-child chunks with) Tj T* (page/section metadata, citations \(source id + span\), "I don't know" on weak retrieval, optional) Tj T* (LLM compression, map-reduce summarization.) Tj T* (- P2: tools `search_documents`, `summarize_document`, `get_page_or_section`, `list_documents`,) Tj T* (`query_table`, `compare_documents`; allow-listed, read-only, scoped to the caller's `doc_id`s.) Tj T* (- P3: LangGraph agent loop \(router, plan, tool, grade, rewrite/retry, answer with citations,) Tj T* (groundedness check\); bounded by steps, tokens and USD; SSE step streaming; configurable) Tj T* (provider.) Tj T* (- P4: per-session memory, prompt-injection defences, per-user rate limit and daily spend cap,) Tj T* (PII-safe logging, ~20-item golden-set eval script.) Tj ET
endstream
