BT /F1 8 Tf 9 TL 30 760 Td (## Architecture) Tj T* (Layers: `api/` \(routers, SSE\) -> `services/` \(ingestion, retrieval, summarization, agent\) ->) Tj T* (`core/` \(config, llm wrapper, model registry, logging\) -> `store/` \(Chroma, doc registry, BM25) Tj T* (index\). Models are loaded once in the FastAPI lifespan and held in a registry; CPU/blocking) Tj T* (work runs in a threadpool. Agent tools call services, never the store directly. One doc per) Tj T* (component plus an overall doc in `docs/architecture/`, written in the PR that introduces the) Tj T* (component.) Tj ET
endstream
