BT /F1 8 Tf 9 TL 30 760 Td (## Data model) Tj T* (- `Document`: `doc_id`, `owner_id`, `filename` \(original\), `mime`, `size`, `sha256`,) Tj T* (`pages_or_sheets`, `created_at`, `status`.) Tj T* (- `Chunk` \(child, embedded\) -> `parent_id` \(larger context span\): `chunk_id`, `doc_id`,) Tj T* (`page|sheet`, `section`, `char_start`, `char_end`, `text`.) Tj T* (- `Citation`: `doc_id`, `filename`, `chunk_id`, `page|sheet`, `span`.) Tj T* (- `Session` \(P4\): `session_id`, `owner_id`, bounded message history.) Tj T* (Registry is SQLite via the stdlib \(no new server\); Chroma holds vectors keyed by `doc_id`) Tj T* (metadata. Re-uploading identical content \(`sha256`\) returns the existing `doc_id`.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
