BT /F1 8 Tf 9 TL 30 760 Td (## AI design \(models, prompts, retrieval/agent loop, guardrails, cost per request\)) Tj T* (Recorded line by line in `docs/ai-design.md` \(rationale per row\). Summary: embeddings `all-) Tj T* (MiniLM-L6-v2` \(local, free\); rerank `bge-reranker-base` \(local\); generation default `claude-) Tj T* (sonnet-5-5` for the agent and `claude-haiku-5-5` for map/grade/compress steps, model ids in) Tj T* (config only; Ollama as the optional local provider. Prompts in `prompts/*.md`, versioned.) Tj T* (Retrieved text and tool output are data, never instructions. Answers must cite or say "I don't) Tj T* (know" when the top rerank score is under a threshold. Target cost: at most $0.05 per agent) Tj T* (request, $0.02 per summarize call on a typical 20-page document.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
