BT /F1 8 Tf 9 TL 30 760 Td (## Evals and targets \(metric, dataset, threshold\)) Tj T* (Golden set `evals/golden.jsonl` \(~20 items, P4\) over small fixture documents in) Tj T* (`evals/fixtures/`. Thresholds live in `evals/thresholds.json` \(already set\): recall@5 >= 0.8,) Tj T* (MRR >= 0.6, faithfulness >= 0.85, relevance >= 0.8, citation_correct >= 0.9, agent task_success) Tj T* (>= 0.8 with avg steps <= 8, injection block rate >= 0.9. Unit/integration tests use the mock) Tj T* (LLM and run free. The full-architecture eval phase is Later.) Tj ET
