BT /F1 8 Tf 9 TL 30 760 Td (## Security and abuse) Tj T* (- Upload: size cap 10 MB \(streamed, rejected before full read\), extension allowlist, content) Tj T* (sniff that must agree with the extension, filename sanitized, temp files always removed, no) Tj T* (code execution from documents.) Tj T* (- Agent: allow-listed read-only tools, every tool call scoped to the caller's `doc_id`s,) Tj T* (bounded steps/tokens/USD per run, tool results treated as untrusted and wrapped in delimiters.) Tj T* (- Per-user rate limit and daily spend cap on every LLM endpoint. Logs never contain document) Tj T* (text or prompts with PII; only ids, sizes, timings, tokens and USD.) Tj T* (- Secrets only from env, documented in `.env.example`. Real key rotation for the committed) Tj T* (`.env` is a human task \(see Risks\).) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
