BT /F1 8 Tf 9 TL 30 760 Td (## Risks) Tj T* (- Committed `.env` contains an `OPEN_AI_API_KEY` and was read by tools earlier; treat as) Tj T* (exposed and rotate \(human\).) Tj T* (- Mistral-7B-class local models are unreliable at tool calling, so Ollama is best-effort for) Tj T* (the agent.) Tj T* (- Local cross-encoder plus embeddings add memory \(~2 GB\) and cold-start time; mitigated by) Tj T* (loading once.) Tj T* (- Hosted-model spend: bounded by per-run and per-day caps; tests never call paid APIs.) Tj ET
endstream
